{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeCarrierEquiv","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeCarrierEquiv","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeAlgebra","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.skeinIwahoriEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.skeinIwahoriEquiv","kind":"def","line":219,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeCarrierEquiv.lean#L219-L225","doc":"**`H^skein_n(q) ≃ₐ H^Iwahori_n(q²)`** over a field, for `q ≠ 0`.\n\nThe parameter moves, not the ring: `Q = q²` and `c = q⁻¹`, both already in `K`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.carrierEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.carrierEquiv","kind":"def","line":200,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeCarrierEquiv.lean#L200-L215","doc":"**The two presentations are the same algebra.**  `σ_i ↦ c • T_i`, with inverse\n`T_i ↦ d • σ_i`; the round trips are `d * c = 1` on generators. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.fromIwahori","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.fromIwahori","kind":"def","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeCarrierEquiv.lean#L172-L195","doc":"**Iwahori presentation → skein presentation**, `T_i ↦ d • σ_i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.toIwahori","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.toIwahori","kind":"def","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeCarrierEquiv.lean#L148-L1